            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Tesla in top 10 brands, hybrid reliability improves: New report",
            "description": "<p>Consumer Reports released its <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.consumerreports.org/cars/cars-driving/talking-cars-487-crs-2026-automotive-report-card-a1582335214/\">latest automotive report card</a>, deciding top brands and vehicles based on reliability, owner satisfaction, safety, and road tests.</p>\n<p>Subaru (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/7270.T\">7270.T</a>), BMW, Porsche (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/POAHY\">POAHY</a>), Honda (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/HMC\">HMC</a>), and Toyota (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TM\">TM</a>) were listed as the best overall brands while Tesla (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/TSLA\">TSLA</a>) climbed to the ninth spot for the first time.</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance Senior Autos Reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/pras-subramanian/\">Pras Subramanian</a> joins Market Catalysts to share takeaways from the report.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Consumer Reports released its latest automotive report card, deciding top brands and vehicles based on reliability, owner satisfaction, safety, and road tests. Subaru (7270.T), BMW, Porsche (POAHY), Honda (HMC), and Toyota (TM) were listed as the best overall brands while Tesla (TSLA) climbed to the ninth spot for the first time. Yahoo Finance Senior Autos Reporter Pras Subramanian joins Market Catalysts to share takeaways from the report. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Catalysts.",
